      "post_id": "2116440749625557291",
      "url": "https://x.com/andyliang17335/status/2116440749625557291",
      "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:02:50Z",
      "text": "Under 100 stars is exactly when a tool like this is most useful, because the format still looks fresh on a feed instead of copied everywhere. The risk is not the model, it is the first 3 seconds: a 3D breakdown that does not explain one surprising mechanism in the opening shot will scroll past no matter how good the render is. After 20 years selling across borders, I have seen 1 strong demo format outperform 20 polished variations that nobody remembers.",
      "original_text": "Under 100 stars is exactly when a tool like this is most useful, because the format still looks fresh on a feed instead of copied everywhere. The risk is not the model, it is the first 3 seconds: a 3D breakdown that does not explain one surprising mechanism in the opening shot will scroll past no matter how good the render is. After 20 years selling across borders, I have seen 1 strong demo format outperform 20 polished variations that nobody remembers.",
      "translation_zh": "低于 100 个星标，正是这种工具最有用的时候，因为这种形式在信息流里看起来仍然新鲜，而不是到处都被复制。风险不在于模型，而在于最开始的 3 秒：如果一个 3D 拆解在开场画面里没有解释一个令人意外的机制，那么无论渲染得多好，都会被划走。做了 20 年跨境销售后，我见过 1 个有力的演示形式，表现胜过 20 个精致但没人记得住的变体。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "author_name": "andy liang",
